{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و\n \n 日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕\n オフショットブログpart2です！✌️\n 写真だらけ〜。 \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H42H725BGT13C4MDAET10","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ゆきだるまちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H43HM1629FD7S4JA4AD03","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ゆきだるまちゃん➁\n こっちのゆきだるまちゃんは女の子かな？🤔\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H44GZJFPA4PA2K1FXY9KP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n みほる！写真いっぱいありがとね！(^^)\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H45GCFYPBETGSEH0BE35Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n みーぱんさん！みーぱんさんの明るさにいつも癒されております…😳\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H46F8EJM2V4Q2WH7JDPKT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 京子さん！どうして雨だと言ったんだろう？がカッコ良すぎてリハからずっとみてました！！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H47JBKPV1CPWEHSVKZF7M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 私ですね！笑\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H48HAJTNEAYC7G1NMFCWN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n みく！みくと一緒に撮ると私も前よりも上手く写真を撮れている気がするんです笑\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H49JG012PEH9X63DG2R1X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n おみそしるコンビ！空き時間に歌を歌いました笑\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3H4APHHDT3114MMR30N87S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 木！！！\n テンション上がりました〜！\n \n 写真いっぱいなブログでした！\n またね！\n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #428"}],"source":"archive"}